  "summary": "Binance says it has replaced about 90 percent of the assets stolen in the 29 October hack by buying them back with its own funds; the stolen funds themselves have not been returned. According to Binance, the remaining 10 percent are less liquid tokens that will be bought gradually, and it has published a Proof of Reserves snapshot. The exchange also says the transfer from its SAFU emergency fund has been completed.",
